# --- Original material: referenced, not duplicated ---------------------------
# The 2023 work is published at
#   https://github.com/lucabnt/mobile-app-download-determinants
# Only what the analysis scripts actually read is versioned here
# (original/data/): duplicating the PDFs, figures and LaTeX sources would add
# ~28 MB without adding anything that is not already referenceable upstream.
# The files stay on the local disk, they are simply untracked.
original/pdf/
original/figures/
original/tex/
original/code/
original/README.original.md

# R
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj

# OS
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Scratch
scratch/
*.tmp

# Raw survey exports and processing workbooks: personal data, never versioned
data_project_*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.sav

# Blog drafts: written here, published on the site, not versioned. An unreviewed
# draft carrying the author's name should not become public as a side effect of
# publishing the analysis.
docs/blog/

# Independent re-computation of the review, and the response to it: kept private by the
# author's choice. Tracked files that mention it say "not published".
review/
